sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Angular as Angular App
    participant AI_Backend as AI Orchestrator<br>(LangChain/Python)
    participant MCP as MCP Server<br>(The Code Above)
    participant REST as Your REST API

    User->>Angular: "Add 'Buy Milk' to my list"
    
    Note right of Angular: Angular already has the<br>User's OAuth Token
    
    Angular->>AI_Backend: Send Message + Token
    
    Note right of AI_Backend: Orchestrator sees tool definition:<br>create_todo(token, title, description)
    
    AI_Backend->>AI_Backend: Inject 'token' into arguments<br>(Hidden from User)
    
    AI_Backend->>MCP: Call Tool: create_todo(token="xyz", title="Buy Milk")
    
    MCP->>REST: POST /todos (Authorization: Bearer xyz)
    REST-->>MCP: 200 OK
    MCP-->>AI_Backend: "Task Created"
    AI_Backend-->>Angular: "I've added Buy Milk to your list."